OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found dead
OL,4,Aat home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man at a home
OL,8,Fin Greater Manchester.
OL,10,FThe victim, a man aged in his 60s, was
OL,11,Fdiscovered after police were called to
OL,12,Fa property in Bryngs Drive, Bolton, at
OL,13,F11:35 BST on Wednesday over welfare
OL,14,Fconcerns.
OL,16,FMark Lord, 63, of Bryngs Drive, has
OL,17,Fbeen charged, remanded in custody, and
OL,18,Fwas due to appear at Manchester
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court later on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
