OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found dead
OL,4,Aat home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an earlier statement, police said
OL,7,Fformal identification of the man who
OL,8,Fdied had yet to take place but officers
OL,9,Fwere in contact with a potential
OL,10,Fnext-of-kin.
